:1,"Greyhound Plasma Steering":1,"Greyhound Plasma Thruster":1,"LP036a Battery Pack":1,"Ramscoop":1,"Scram Drive":1,"Small Radar Jammer":1,"Supercapacitor":4,"nGVF-AA Fuel Cell":1},"description":"The Venditor class is Louise Conglomerate's risk-zone alternative to the common dull Syndicate freighter without a proper name that is more popular on the peaceful inner trade lanes and which not even has a proper name. The Venditor was designed under the premise that a light freighter should be able to flee quickly into hyperspace, instead of risking a fight it would likely loose anyway. Nevertheless there are stories about daring junior traders who mount blaster turrets instead of anti-missile ones, and go into counterattacks or even hunt smaller pirate parties. Not the smartest thing to do, but well, you know those youngsters.","variants":{"Venditor :LCS (Hai)":{"\"Benga\" Atomic Thruster":1,"\"Biroo\" Atomic Steering":1,"Bullfrog Anti-Missile":2,"Hai Corundum Regenerator":2,"Hai Cuttlefish Jammer":1,"Hai Gorge Batteries":1,"Hyperdrive":1,"Sand Cell":1},"Venditor :LCS (Atomic Blaster)":{"A250 Atomic Thruster":1,"A255 Atomic Steering":1,"Blaster Turret":2,"D41-HY Shield Generator":1,"LP072a Battery Pack":1,"Ramscoop":1,"Scram Drive":1,"Small Radar Jammer":1,"Supercapacitor":1,"nGVF-AA Fuel Cell":1}},"soldAt":[],"obtainable":true,"source":"Louise.Conglomerate.Shipyards"}},"outfits":{},"systems":{}}